    {
      "id": "claim_aed6264ca9fb4334b0095c619f8deb4c",
      "statement": "EngineAutoConfiguration conditionally supplies in-memory user, refresh-token, blacklist, audit, and password ports plus an AuthService, while the later EngineSecurityBeansConfiguration only supplies its JPA/security alternatives when the corresponding bean is missing; TokenServicePort is normally supplied by JwtServiceAdapter because EngineAutoConfiguration does not define it.",
